WEBVTT

00:11:00.496 --> 00:11:09.954
Internal pain always comes out always and
who pays the price we do our children.

00:11:11.079 --> 00:11:14.787
Our colleagues. Our communities.

00:11:19.787 --> 00:11:25.579
Now, don't get me wrong, I'm not anti
happiness. I like being happy.

00:11:25.912 --> 00:11:27.162
I'm a pretty happy person.

00:11:28.579 --> 00:11:33.246
But when we push aside normal emotions
to embrace false positivity,